  "expirationDate": "2034-11-26",
  "historyNote": "#5840, eff 6-17-94; ss by #6786, eff 7-1-98, EXPIRED: 7-1-06 New. #10568, eff 4-18-14; ss by #14129, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
